<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Ascend Communications Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Ascend gained 1-/18 to 54-7/8.</p>
